{"5077680":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Last Exit Diner: The Last Train","steam_appid":5077680,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5145280],"detailed_description":"The Whiteout swallowed the outer settlements. One armoured train still runs the Endless Rail Circuit, carrying supplies, survivors, and fifty varieties of deeply questionable advertising.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep the Last Train Moving<\/h2><br>Last Exit Diner: The Last Train is a fast six-minute rail-survival game. Your five wagons are the line between a hungry sky and the Last Exit. Automatic roof guns hold the swarm back, but the train's enormous Dreadnought cannon answers directly to you.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Man the Dreadnought.<\/strong> Hold to traverse its six barrels and central cannon shot across the battlefield.<br><\/li><li><strong>Defend five individual wagons.<\/strong> Every surviving wagon earns a mastery star at the end of the route.<br><\/li><li><strong>Fight a hostile flying ecosystem.<\/strong> Swarms overwhelm, latchers disable roof guns, chargers hit hard, and screamers strengthen everything around them.<br><\/li><li><strong>Choose your build on the move.<\/strong> Rail upgrades arrive roughly every 30 seconds, mixing permanent refits, consumable countermeasures, bombs, and specialized ammunition.<br><\/li><li><strong>Cross ten escalating biomes.<\/strong> Each route brings its own scenery, hazards, enemies, starting speed, and health pressure.<br><\/li><li><strong>Chase the Last Exit.<\/strong> Survive the six-minute run, protect every wagon, and turn bounty into local high-score glory.<\/li><\/ul><br>Keep it moving. Keep the guns firing. Reach the Last Exit.","about_the_game":"The Whiteout swallowed the outer settlements. One armoured train still runs the Endless Rail Circuit, carrying supplies, survivors, and fifty varieties of deeply questionable advertising.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep the Last Train Moving<\/h2><br>Last Exit Diner: The Last Train is a fast six-minute rail-survival game. Your five wagons are the line between a hungry sky and the Last Exit. Automatic roof guns hold the swarm back, but the train's enormous Dreadnought cannon answers directly to you.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Man the Dreadnought.<\/strong> Hold to traverse its six barrels and central cannon shot across the battlefield.<br><\/li><li><strong>Defend five individual wagons.<\/strong> Every surviving wagon earns a mastery star at the end of the route.<br><\/li><li><strong>Fight a hostile flying ecosystem.<\/strong> Swarms overwhelm, latchers disable roof guns, chargers hit hard, and screamers strengthen everything around them.<br><\/li><li><strong>Choose your build on the move.<\/strong> Rail upgrades arrive roughly every 30 seconds, mixing permanent refits, consumable countermeasures, bombs, and specialized ammunition.<br><\/li><li><strong>Cross ten escalating biomes.<\/strong> Each route brings its own scenery, hazards, enemies, starting speed, and health pressure.<br><\/li><li><strong>Chase the Last Exit.<\/strong> Survive the six-minute run, protect every wagon, and turn bounty into local high-score glory.<\/li><\/ul><br>Keep it moving. Keep the guns firing. Reach the Last Exit.","short_description":"Defend an armoured diner train through six-minute runs across ten hostile biomes. Aim the Dreadnought cannon, deploy bombs, survive flying monsters, and choose rail upgrades while automatic roof guns keep the Last Train moving.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5077680\/e76c48fef64076dfc7e4c1029cfed97386b62215\/header.jpg?t=1793716234","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5077680\/057b432650c2c91a0191eeef9425b6803d7a6d9a\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793716234","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5077680\/057b432650c2c91a0191eee